  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska Institutet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Institute</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska Institutet &#xE4;r en myndighet direkt underordnad  Utrikesdepartementet. Svenska Institutet har sedan 1988 administrerat kulturutbyte med utvecklingsl&#xE4;nder enligt &#xF6;verenskommelser med Sida. Kulturprojekten omfattar akt&#xF6;rer inom dans, film, konst, litteratur, musik, teater, arkitektur, barnkultur och kulturarv.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Institute (SI) is a government authority subordinated to the Ministry for Foreign Affairs (MFA). SI&apos;s main responsibility is to inform about and promote Sweden abroad, mainly through cultural activities. Since 1988, SI also has the task of administering cultural exchange with developing countries, with funds from Sida at an approximate annual amount of 12 MSEK.</narrative>
  </description>
